# Do not let Prettier touch the docs. It breaks the rendered site.
#
# mkdocs.yml enables admonition, pymdownx.details, superfences and tabbed —
# all of which mark block content by 4-space indentation that CommonMark does
# not recognise. Prettier strips that indent, so an admonition body escapes
# its block:
#
#     !!! info "Why Authentication Matters"
#         Your account identifies you in the infoRouter system.   <- indent removed
#
# mkdocs-material then renders an empty callout followed by loose text. The
# markdown still parses, so nothing errors — it just looks wrong on the live
# site. Measured 2026-07-28: Prettier 3.7.4 on defaults would rewrite 151 of
# 152 markdown files and de-indent admonition bodies in 127 of them.
#
# Trigger is editor format-on-save (Cursor + esbenp.prettier-vscode), which
# honours this file.
*.md

